   {
    "type": "column",
    "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires",
    "items": [
     {
      "type": "mainHeadline",
      "text": "A Perfect Day in Buenos Aires",
      "variant": "HEADING_XL",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_title",
      "isBold": true
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>15. September 2026 | 2 min read | Julia Buth</b>",
      "size": "SMALL",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_info"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Purser Julia Buth aus Frankfurt verbringt regelmäßig Zeit in Buenos Aires und verrät die besten Tipps für einen perfekten Tag in der argentinischen Hauptstadt.</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_description_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_separator"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Vormittag</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_paragraph_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par0/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/de/article-images/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires/lh_app_buenos-aires_plaza-dorrego_tango_getty1211337952_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Eine Paar, die Frau in einem roten Kleid, der Mann mit beigem Jackett und schwarzer Hose, tanzt Tango auf einem Platz im Freien."
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Frühstück im Café Tortoni</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_paragraph_1"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Mein Tag beginnt im traditionsreichen Café Tortoni, dem ältesten Café der Stadt</li><li>Besonders empfehle ich die Medialunas mit Dulce de Leche – ein argentinischer Klassiker</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_paragraph_2"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Café Tortoni, Av. de Mayo 825",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_paragraph_3"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>San Telmo entdecken</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_paragraph_4"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Das historische Viertel San Telmo ist der perfekte Ort, um das Straßenleben von Buenos Aires zu erleben</li><li>Mein Tipp: über die Plaza Dorrego schlendern und sonntags den berühmten Kunsthandwerks- und Trödelmarkt besuchen</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_paragraph_5"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Plaza Dorrego, San Telmo",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_paragraph_6"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Mittag</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_paragraph_7"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par7/image_copy",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/de/article-images/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires/lh_app_buenos-aires_juan-pablo-mascanfroni_unsplash-1vumey9jdwk_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Blick auf das Planetarium Galileo Galilei im Viertel Palermo in Buenos Aires."
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Empanadas in der Markthalle San Telmo</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_paragraph_8"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Die historische Markthalle von San Telmo gehört zu meinen Lieblingsorten</li><li>Bei El Hornero gibt es Empanadas in vielen Variationen – meine Favoriten sind die mit Käsefüllung</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_paragraph_9"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Mercado de San Telmo, Defensa 963, San Telmo",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/south-america/a-perfect-day-in-buenos-aires_paragraph_10"
     },
     {
